{"content":[{"c":["PEARL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Gem formed within the shell of certain mollusks. The word appears only once in the OT (",{"href":"?bref=Job.28.18","r":"Job.28.18","rawR":"Job.28.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Job.28.18","value":"Job.28.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jb 28:18"},"). However, some think that the reference to a reddish stone in ",{"href":"?bref=Lam.4.7","r":"Lam.4.7","rawR":"Lam.4.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lam.4.7","value":"Lam.4.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lamentations 4:7"}," may be to the pink pearl found in the Red Sea. By the NT period, the pearl was a prized piece of feminine jewelry (",{"href":"?bref=1Tim.2.9","r":"1Tim.2.9","rawR":"1Tim.2.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Tim.2.9","value":"1Tim.2.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Tm 2:9"},"), an item of trade (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.13.45-46","r":"Matt.13.45-46","rawR":"Matt.13.45-46","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.13.45-46","value":"Matt.13.45-46"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 13:45-46"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Rev.18.12-16","r":"Rev.18.12-16","rawR":"Rev.18.12-16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.18.12-16","value":"Rev.18.12-16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Rv 18:12-16"},"), and an object of high price. Being familiar objects, pearls were frequently used by Jesus in his illustrations. A fine pearl was an object of such great value that a man might sell all his accumulated wealth to purchase it (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.13.45-46","r":"Matt.13.45-46","rawR":"Matt.13.45-46","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.13.45-46","value":"Matt.13.45-46"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 13:45-46"},"). A pearl (used figuratively for the word of the Lord) would not be given to those who, like pigs, had no appreciation for its value (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.7.6","r":"Matt.7.6","rawR":"Matt.7.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.7.6","value":"Matt.7.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"7:6"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=StonesPrecious_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"StonesPrecious_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"StonesPrecious_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Stones, Precious"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Pearl","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jb 28:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Job.28.18","rawQueryValue":"Job.28.18","sourceRefExact":"Job.28.18"},{"anchorText":"Lamentations 4:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lam.4.7","rawQueryValue":"Lam.4.7","sourceRefExact":"Lam.4.7"},{"anchorText":"1 Tm 2:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Tim.2.9","rawQueryValue":"1Tim.2.9","sourceRefExact":"1Tim.2.9"},{"anchorText":"Mt 13:45-46","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.13.45-46","rawQueryValue":"Matt.13.45-46","sourceRefExact":"Matt.13.45-46"},{"anchorText":"Rv 18:12-16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.18.12-16","rawQueryValue":"Rev.18.12-16","sourceRefExact":"Rev.18.12-16"},{"anchorText":"Mt 13:45-46","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.13.45-46","rawQueryValue":"Matt.13.45-46","sourceRefExact":"Matt.13.45-46"},{"anchorText":"7:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.7.6","rawQueryValue":"Matt.7.6","sourceRefExact":"Matt.7.6"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e4e3bd46abf99e49b0e3e7b35cf937c94af23a6f03c38b461ae9146ece5d229b","sourceItemName":"Pearl","sourceItemOrder":78,"sourceMember":"Articles/P.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Pearl","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Pearl","title":"Pearl","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}